From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:33:12 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 269/297] Meridian: Put to Sleep in a tab's menu

Discards the tab with Chromium's lifecycle unit to free its memory (it
reloads when opened), after Meridian's own check: never the open tab, a
page typed into, one playing sound or video, one using the camera,
microphone or a share, the Workbench, or a tab an agent works in. A toast
says what happened.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
